# Tham so duong LLM cuc bo cho space `real` (story 2.11) - KHONG chua secret.
#
# File nay KHONG di vao `docker compose --env-file`: no la lop dap len
# `.env.server` cho *mot lan chay CLI*, khong phai cau hinh cua stack. Service
# `api` va `man-nap` van chay DeepSeek + OpenAI cho space `synth`; doi mac dinh
# cua chung la doi ca duong san pham.
#
#   HYPER_RAG_CUC_BO=1 scripts/chay-may-chu.sh nap /root/hyper-rag-data/real --space real
#
# Vi sao la mot file chu khong phai hai bien tren dong lenh: `chay-may-chu.sh`
# `source` .env va .env.server duoi `set -a`, nen mot `LLM_MODEL=... script...`
# truyen trong moi truong bi chinh hai lenh source do ghi de - im lang, va nguoi
# chay tuong minh dang goi Qwen trong khi that ra dang goi DeepSeek tren du lieu
# cong ty. File nay duoc source *sau*, nen no thang.
#
# Ten model phai co trong config/danh-muc-model.yaml (tests/test_compose_ha_tang.py).
LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b
EMBEDDING_MODEL=bge-m3
# OLLAMA_HOST co y KHONG khai o day: `http://ollama:11434` chi phan giai duoc
# ben trong network compose, con script nay chay tren host. Script tu tra IP
# container `ollama` va export de len, dung cach no lam voi ba kho.
